id: flash-wmode
section: Flash
item: Each wmode draws at the element's bounds and takes a tap; a transparent movie shows the page behind it
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm1&bg=00ff00&wmode=window
kit: cavekit-flash.md R4
wait text ready stage= 30
expect flash-behind m 00ff00 no
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm1&bg=00ff00&wmode=opaque
wait text ready stage= 30
expect flash-behind m 00ff00 no
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm1&bg=00ff00&wmode=transparent
wait text ready stage= 30
expect flash-behind m 00ff00 yes
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm1&bg=00ff00&wmode=direct
wait text ready stage= 30
expect flash-behind m 00ff00 no
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm1&bg=00ff00&wmode=gpu
wait text ready stage= 30
expect flash-behind m 00ff00 no
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect flash-at 200 150 3
